The Gantt chart shows a sports field lighting installation. All times are in days.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, x=0.5cm]
\foreach \t in {0,1,...,18} \draw[gray!30] (\t,-0.5) -- (\t,3.8);
